---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: 문의하기
eyebrow: Contact Us
lead: 제품 기술, 견적 및 지원 요청을 남겨주세요.
section: contact
description: (주)트라이얼정보통신 문의하기입니다.
cta: false
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <form class="form" data-inquiry-form
          {% if site.formEndpoint %}action="{{ site.formEndpoint }}"{% endif %}
          method="post" data-mailto="{{ site.contact.email }}" novalidate>
      <div class="form__honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
        <label for="_gotcha">이 칸은 비워 두세요</label>
        <input type="text" id="_gotcha" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
      </div>

      <fieldset class="field">
        <legend class="field__label">관심 솔루션 <span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></legend>
        <label><input type="radio" name="solution" value="H/W" checked> H/W</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="solution" value="S/W"> S/W</label>
      </fieldset>

      <div class="form__row">
        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="name">성명 <span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="성명을 입력해주세요." required autocomplete="name">
          <p class="field__error">성명을 입력해 주세요.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="position">직책</label>
          <input type="text" id="position" name="position" placeholder="직책을 입력해주세요." autocomplete="organization-title">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form__row">
        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="company">회사명</label>
          <input type="text" id="company" name="company" placeholder="회사명을 입력해주세요." autocomplete="organization">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="department">부서명</label>
          <input type="text" id="department" name="department" placeholder="부서명을 입력해주세요.">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form__row">
        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="phone">연락처 <span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="연락처를 입력해주세요." required autocomplete="tel">
          <p class="field__error">연락처를 입력해 주세요.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="email">이메일 <span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="이메일을 입력해주세요." required autocomplete="email">
          <p class="field__error">이메일 형식을 확인해 주세요.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <fieldset class="field">
        <legend class="field__label">문의내용 <span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></legend>
        <label><input type="radio" name="category" value="제품 기술문의" checked> 제품 기술문의</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="category" value="견적문의"> 견적 문의</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="category" value="지원요청"> 지원요청</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="category" value="기타"> 기타</label>
      </fieldset>
      <div class="field">
        <label class="sr-only" for="message">문의내용</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="문의내용을 입력해주세요." required></textarea>
        <p class="field__error">문의 내용을 입력해 주세요.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form__actions">
        <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">전송하기</button>
        <p class="form__status" data-form-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
